#ASSERT `Art 65(6) the Board has established the two standing sub-groups` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 65(6) the Board has established the two standing sub-groups` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
