#ASSERT `Art 66 the Board has advised and assisted the Commission and the Member States` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 66 the Board has advised and assisted the Commission and the Member States` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 66 the Board has advised and assisted the Commission and the Member States` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Art 66 the tasks: each item of the list, an item the text does not name, and a day before the group applies
#ASSERT `Art 66 the task is one the Board may perform in particular` (Date 2 8 2025) "contribute to the coordination among national competent authorities responsible for the application of this Regulation" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 66 the task is one the Board may perform in particular` (Date 2 8 2025) "collect and share technical and regulatory expertise and best practices among Member States" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 66 the task is one the Board may perform in particular` (Date 2 8 2025) "provide advice on the implementation of this Regulation, in particular as regards the enforcement of rules on general-purpose AI models" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 66 the task is one the Board may perform in particular` (Date 2 8 2025) "contribute to the harmonisation of administrative practices in the Member States, including in relation to the derogation from the conformity assessment procedures referred to in Article 46, the functioning of AI regulatory sandboxes, and testing in real world conditions referred to in Articles 57, 59 and 60" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 66 the task is one the Board may perform in particular` (Date 2 8 2025) "issue recommendations and written opinions on any relevant matters related to the implementation of this Regulation and to its consistent and effective application" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 66 the task is one the Board may perform in particular` (Date 2 8 2025) "support the Commission in promoting AI literacy, public awareness and understanding of the benefits, risks, safeguards and rights and obligations in relation to the use of AI systems" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 66 the task is one the Board may perform in particular` (Date 2 8 2025) "facilitate the development of common criteria and a shared understanding among market operators and competent authorities of the relevant concepts provided for in this Regulation, including by contributing to the development of benchmarks" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 66 the task is one the Board may perform in particular` (Date 2 8 2025) "contribute to effective cooperation with the competent authorities of third countries and with international organisations" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 66 the task is one the Board may perform in particular` (Date 2 8 2025) "assist national competent authorities and the Commission in developing the organisational and technical expertise required for the implementation of this Regulation, including by contributing to the assessment of training needs for staff of Member States involved in implementing this Regulation" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 66 the task is one the Board may perform in particular` (Date 2 8 2025) "assist the AI Office in supporting national competent authorities in the establishment and development of AI regulatory sandboxes, and facilitate cooperation and information-sharing among AI regulatory sandboxes" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 66 the task is one the Board may perform in particular` (Date 2 8 2025) "contribute to, and provide relevant advice on, the development of guidance documents" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 66 the task is one the Board may perform in particular` (Date 2 8 2025) "advise the Commission in relation to international matters on AI" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 66 the task is one the Board may perform in particular` (Date 2 8 2025) "provide opinions to the Commission on the qualified alerts regarding general-purpose AI models" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 66 the task is one the Board may perform in particular` (Date 2 8 2025) "receive opinions by the Member States on qualified alerts regarding general-purpose AI models, and on national experiences and practices on the monitoring and enforcement of AI systems, in particular systems integrating the general-purpose AI models" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 66 the task is one the Board may perform in particular` (Date 2 8 2025) "something the text does not name" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 66 the task is one the Board may perform in particular` (Date 1 8 2025) "contribute to the coordination among national competent authorities responsible for the application of this Regulation" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT count `Art 66 the tasks the Board may perform in particular` EQUALS 14
