#TRACE `Art 70(2) the Member State's duty to make publicly available the information on how competent authorities and single points of contact can be contacted` (Date 2 8 2025) (Date 2 8 2025) AT (Day (Date 2 8 2025)) WITH
    PARTY `Art 70 Member State` DOES `Art 70(2) make the information on how competent authorities and single points of contact can be contacted publicly available` AT (Day (Date 2 8 2025))
